                                   "title":  "Letterboxd review of Drive My Car",
                                   "snippet":  "[Letterboxd Review of \"Drive My Car\"] my therapist likes to stop me whenever i criticize myself with the word ‘should,\u0027 that i should feel some way, that i should have done something. we stop and dig into this statement until i get to the root of it and try to understand how i\u0027ve internalized whatever idea or feeling or action is meant to be \"correct\" or \"normal.\" it\u0027s a hard thing for me to do because it\u0027s always easiest to lightly lean on myself as the real problem, and even when i\u0027m able to understand it as a behavior i\u0027ve learned from outside of myself, it\u0027s difficult to think of that external force without declaring it right",
