                                   "title":  "Drive My Car (2021) - User reviews - IMDb",
                                   "snippet":  "The entire section of the movie dedicated to the selection of actors, rehearsals and the three shows (one with \u0027Waiting for Godot\u0027 and two with \u0027Uncle Vania\u0027) demonstrate deep understanding and passion for theater and an organic integration in the main story, in the good tradition of the films of Ingmar Bergman or Istvan Szabo.",
